---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from './PageHeader.astro';
import Callout from './Callout.astro';
import CodeBlock from './CodeBlock.astro';

interface Props { lang: 'en' | 'id' }
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const id = lang === 'id';
---

<DocsLayout title={id ? 'Operasional' : 'Operations'}>
  <PageHeader eyebrow="Runbook" title={id ? 'Operasional, readiness, dan recovery' : 'Operations, readiness, and recovery'} description={id ? 'Pisahkan liveness proses, readiness control plane, dan status session WhatsApp. Gunakan audit untuk diagnosis sebelum rebind atau restart.' : 'Separate process liveness, control-plane readiness, and WhatsApp session state. Use audit evidence before rebinding or restarting.'} />

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-4">Health & readiness</h2>
  <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-7"><div class="border border-[#262626] rounded-lg p-5"><code class="text-[#fafafa]">GET /health</code><p class="text-sm text-[#71717a] mt-2">{id ? 'Liveness proses HTTP. Tetap ok selama process dapat melayani request.' : 'HTTP process liveness. Remains ok while the process can serve requests.'}</p></div><div class="border border-[#262626] rounded-lg p-5"><code class="text-[#fafafa]">GET /ready</code><p class="text-sm text-[#71717a] mt-2">{id ? 'ok, degraded, atau not_ready beserta check storage/DB/lease/credential/session.' : 'ok, degraded, or not_ready plus storage/DB/lease/credential/session checks.'}</p></div><div class="border border-[#262626] rounded-lg p-5"><code class="text-[#fafafa]">GET /whatsapp/status</code><p class="text-sm text-[#71717a] mt-2">{id ? 'Session, binding, dan account-health truth.' : 'Session, binding, and account-health truth.'}</p></div></div>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] mb-4">{id ? '/ready mengembalikan HTTP 200 untuk ok dan degraded, lalu HTTP 503 hanya untuk not_ready. WhatsApp bound tetapi disconnected adalah degraded, bukan alasan otomatis untuk membunuh process; storage/DB/instance ownership yang tidak usable adalah not_ready.' : '/ready returns HTTP 200 for ok and degraded, and HTTP 503 only for not_ready. A bound but disconnected WhatsApp session is degraded rather than an automatic process-kill signal; unusable storage/DB/instance ownership is not_ready.'}</p>
  <Callout title={id ? 'Dashboard menampilkan degraded state' : 'Dashboard surfaces degraded state'} tone="warning">{id ? 'Credential persistence failure atau bound session yang disconnected muncul sebagai warning operasional dengan recovery action. Jangan restart sebelum memastikan /app/data sehat bila save credential gagal.' : 'Credential persistence failures or a disconnected bound session appear as an operational warning with a recovery action. Do not restart before confirming /app/data health when credential saves fail.'}</Callout>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mt-9 mb-3">{id ? 'Storage dan single-instance guard' : 'Storage and single-instance guard'}</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] mb-4">{id ? 'Production melakukan mount inspection sebelum SQLite dibuka. Root overlay, tmpfs, ramfs, atau mount yang tidak dapat diverifikasi ditolak dengan PERSISTENT_DATA_REQUIRED.' : 'Production inspects the data mount before SQLite opens. Root overlay, tmpfs, ramfs, or unverifiable storage is rejected with PERSISTENT_DATA_REQUIRED.'}</p>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] mb-4">{id ? 'Setelah DB siap, Wago mengambil singleton lease di SQLite. Owner melakukan heartbeat periodik; contender pada volume yang sama gagal startup dengan WAGO_INSTANCE_ALREADY_ACTIVE. Jika heartbeat tidak dapat dipersist atau ownership hilang, owner fail closed dan masuk shutdown.' : 'After the database is ready, Wago acquires a singleton SQLite lease. The owner heartbeats periodically; a contender using the same volume fails startup with WAGO_INSTANCE_ALREADY_ACTIVE. If heartbeat persistence or ownership is lost, the owner fails closed and enters shutdown.'}</p>
  <Callout title={id ? 'Deployment tetap replica=1' : 'Deployment remains replica=1'} tone="warning">{id ? 'Lease mencegah overlap accidental, tetapi Wago bukan clustered service. Gunakan stop-old-before-start-new dan jangan menjalankan active-active pada auth directory yang sama.' : 'The lease prevents accidental overlap, but Wago is not a clustered service. Use stop-old-before-start-new and never run active-active against the same auth directory.'}</Callout>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mt-9 mb-3">{id ? 'Status koneksi dan session recovery' : 'Connection state and session recovery'}</h2>
  <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6"><table class="w-full text-sm"><thead><tr class="border-b border-[#262626] text-[#71717a]"><th class="py-2 pr-4 text-left">State</th><th class="py-2 text-left">{id ? 'Makna operasional' : 'Operational meaning'}</th></tr></thead><tbody class="divide-y divide-[#1a1a1a] text-[#a1a1aa]"><tr><td class="py-3 pr-4"><code>connecting</code></td><td>{id ? 'Socket sedang membangun/memulihkan koneksi.' : 'The socket is establishing or restoring connectivity.'}</td></tr><tr><td class="py-3 pr-4"><code>qr</code></td><td>{id ? 'QR tersedia dan perlu dipindai.' : 'A QR is available and must be scanned.'}</td></tr><tr><td class="py-3 pr-4"><code>connected</code></td><td>{id ? 'Session aktif.' : 'The session is active.'}</td></tr><tr><td class="py-3 pr-4"><code>disconnected</code></td><td>{id ? 'Tidak ada socket aktif; inspect audit/reconnect/session validity.' : 'No active socket; inspect audit/reconnect/session validity.'}</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] mb-4">{id ? 'Persisted auth yang corrupt/unreadable tidak lagi membuat seluruh app boot-loop. Wago tetap membuka control plane, menandai session disconnected/session_invalid, dan mencatat baileys.session.resume_failed agar operator dapat melakukan explicit rebind bila diperlukan.' : 'Corrupt or unreadable persisted auth no longer boot-loops the entire app. Wago keeps the control plane available, marks the session disconnected/session_invalid, and records baileys.session.resume_failed so an operator can explicitly rebind when required.'}</p>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] mb-8">{id ? 'saveCreds failure juga tidak disembunyikan sebagai healthy. Readiness menjadi degraded sampai credential write berikutnya berhasil.' : 'saveCreds failures are not hidden as healthy. Readiness remains degraded until a later credential write succeeds.'}</p>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-3">Audit API</h2>
  <CodeBlock label="cURL" code={`curl "$WAGO_URL/activity?source=baileys&category=connection&level=warning&limit=50" \\
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $WAGO_API_KEY"`} />
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] mb-4">{id ? 'Audit menyimpan operational evidence yang disanitasi di SQLite. QR, credential, raw message body, auth token, dan identifier penuh tidak dipersist sebagai audit payload.' : 'Audit stores sanitized operational evidence in SQLite. QR values, credentials, raw message bodies, auth tokens, and full identifiers are not persisted as audit payloads.'}</p>
  <Callout title="Bounded retention">{id ? 'SQLite mempertahankan 2.000 audit event terbaru. Ini bukan message history atau raw protocol capture.' : 'SQLite retains the newest 2,000 audit events. This is not message history or a raw protocol capture.'}</Callout>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mt-9 mb-3">{id ? 'Webhook delivery: at-least-once' : 'Webhook delivery: at least once'}</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] mb-4">{id ? 'Wago mempersistenkan callback sebelum network delivery. Retryable failure, stale in-flight claim, process interruption, dan manual redelivery dapat menghasilkan callback berulang.' : 'Wago persists callbacks before network delivery. Retryable failures, stale in-flight claims, process interruption, and manual redelivery can produce repeated callbacks.'}</p>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] mb-4">{id ? 'Consumer wajib idempotent dan dedupe menggunakan Webhook-Id / X-Wago-Delivery. Retry dan manual redelivery mempertahankan delivery ID dan payload identity yang sama. Jika consumer berhasil commit tetapi Wago crash sebelum completeAttempt, callback yang sama dapat dikirim lagi setelah claim recovery.' : 'Consumers must be idempotent and deduplicate with Webhook-Id / X-Wago-Delivery. Retry and manual redelivery preserve the same delivery ID and payload identity. If the consumer commits successfully but Wago crashes before completeAttempt, the same callback can be delivered again after claim recovery.'}</p>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mt-9 mb-3">{id ? 'API key dan browser-session recovery' : 'API key and browser-session recovery'}</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] mb-4">{id ? 'Rotasi generated API key mencabut key lama serta semua browser session lain. Session yang melakukan rotasi dipertahankan agar operator dapat menyimpan key baru. Baileys auth tidak disentuh.' : 'Rotating a generated API key invalidates the old key and every other browser session. The session performing the rotation is preserved so the operator can save the new key. Baileys auth is untouched.'}</p>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] mb-8">{id ? 'Sign out all mencabut semua dashboard session tanpa mengubah API key machine atau WhatsApp auth.' : 'Sign out all revokes every dashboard session without changing the machine API key or WhatsApp auth.'}</p>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-3">{id ? 'Backup /app/data' : 'Back up /app/data'}</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] mb-4">{id ? 'Gunakan controlled stop agar webhook worker berhenti, credential write queue ter-flush, dan SQLite WAL di-checkpoint sebelum snapshot filesystem.' : 'Use a controlled stop so the webhook worker stops, the credential-write queue flushes, and SQLite WAL is checkpointed before the filesystem snapshot.'}</p>
  <CodeBlock label="shell" code={`docker compose stop wago\nVOLUME=$(docker inspect "$(docker compose ps -aq wago)" --format '{{range .Mounts}}{{if eq .Destination "/app/data"}}{{.Name}}{{end}}{{end}}')\nmkdir -p backups\ndocker run --rm \\
  -v "$VOLUME:/data:ro" \\
  -v "$PWD/backups:/backup" \\
  alpine:3.22 tar -C /data -czf /backup/wago-data.tgz .\nchmod 600 backups/wago-data.tgz\ndocker compose start wago`} />
  <Callout title={id ? 'Backup harus mencakup seluruh state set' : 'Back up the entire state set'} tone="warning">{id ? 'Jangan copy hanya wago.db dari service live. Snapshot konsisten harus mencakup database dan auth directory dari titik waktu yang sama. Archive berisi WhatsApp credential dan webhook signing secret.' : 'Do not copy only wago.db from a live service. A consistent snapshot must include the database and auth directory from the same point in time. The archive contains WhatsApp credentials and the webhook signing secret.'}</Callout>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mt-9 mb-3">Restore rehearsal</h2>
  <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] space-y-2 mb-5"><li>{id ? 'Gunakan environment terisolasi dan pastikan tidak ada Wago lain yang menunjuk backup volume.' : 'Use an isolated environment and confirm no other Wago instance points at the restored volume.'}</li><li>{id ? 'Stop target Wago dan restore archive ke /app/data target.' : 'Stop the target Wago and restore the archive into the target /app/data.'}</li><li>{id ? 'Verifikasi ownership/permission host sesuai deployment; backup archive sendiri tetap private/restricted.' : 'Verify host ownership/permissions for the deployment; keep the backup archive private/restricted.'}</li><li>{id ? 'Start tepat satu Wago, lalu cek /health, /ready, app ID, browser/API auth, binding/session state, webhook settings, dan audit.' : 'Start exactly one Wago, then verify /health, /ready, app ID, browser/API auth, binding/session state, webhook settings, and audit.'}</li><li>{id ? 'Jangan lakukan rebind hanya karena restore; rebind hanya bila audit/session truth menunjukkan auth memang invalid.' : 'Do not rebind merely because a restore occurred; rebind only when audit/session truth shows auth is actually invalid.'}</li></ol>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mt-10 mb-4">Troubleshooting</h2>
  <div class="overflow-x-auto"><table class="w-full text-sm"><thead><tr class="border-b border-[#262626] text-[#71717a]"><th class="py-2.5 pr-4 text-left">{id ? 'Gejala' : 'Symptom'}</th><th class="py-2.5 text-left">{id ? 'Periksa' : 'Check'}</th></tr></thead><tbody class="divide-y divide-[#1a1a1a] text-[#a1a1aa]"><tr><td class="py-3 pr-4 text-[#fafafa]">PERSISTENT_DATA_REQUIRED</td><td>{id ? 'Mount /app/data ke volume/bind persisten. Jangan gunakan root overlay/tmpfs.' : 'Mount /app/data on a persistent volume/bind. Do not use root overlay/tmpfs.'}</td></tr><tr><td class="py-3 pr-4 text-[#fafafa]">WAGO_INSTANCE_ALREADY_ACTIVE</td><td>{id ? 'Ada owner lease lain pada volume. Hentikan duplicate replica; tunggu lease stale hanya setelah memastikan owner lama benar-benar mati.' : 'Another lease owner exists on the volume. Stop duplicate replicas; wait for lease expiry only after confirming the old owner is truly gone.'}</td></tr><tr><td class="py-3 pr-4 text-[#fafafa]">403 SETUP_CODE_REQUIRED</td><td>{id ? 'Klik Pair WhatsApp lalu masukkan one-time setup code terbaru dari deployment/container log.' : 'Click Pair WhatsApp and enter the newest one-time setup code from deployment/container logs.'}</td></tr><tr><td class="py-3 pr-4 text-[#fafafa]">403 INVALID_SETUP_CODE</td><td>{id ? 'Gunakan code terbaru. Fresh instance yang restart sebelum bootstrap selesai akan menghasilkan setup code baru dan meng-invalidasi code sebelumnya.' : 'Use the newest code. A fresh instance restarted before bootstrap completes generates a new setup code and invalidates the previous one.'}</td></tr><tr><td class="py-3 pr-4 text-[#fafafa]">403 WEB_BOOTSTRAP_DISABLED</td><td>{id ? 'Restart fresh Wago dan periksa log untuk setup code baru, atau pre-provision API_KEY. Jangan membuka anonymous bootstrap.' : 'Restart the fresh Wago instance and inspect logs for a new setup code, or pre-provision API_KEY. Do not open anonymous bootstrap.'}</td></tr><tr><td class="py-3 pr-4 text-[#fafafa]">/ready degraded</td><td>{id ? 'Lihat checks. Jangan anggap /health gagal; ikuti reason credential/session yang diberikan.' : 'Inspect checks. Do not treat this as /health failure; follow the credential/session reason.'}</td></tr><tr><td class="py-3 pr-4 text-[#fafafa]">/ready 503 not_ready</td><td>{id ? 'Periksa storage, database, dan instance ownership sebelum restart.' : 'Check storage, database, and instance ownership before restarting.'}</td></tr><tr><td class="py-3 pr-4 text-[#fafafa]">baileys.session.resume_failed</td><td>{id ? 'Control plane tetap tersedia. Inspect audit dan gunakan explicit rebind hanya bila persisted auth tidak dapat dipulihkan.' : 'The control plane remains available. Inspect audit and use explicit rebind only when persisted auth cannot be recovered.'}</td></tr><tr><td class="py-3 pr-4 text-[#fafafa]">baileys.credentials.persist_failed</td><td>{id ? 'Periksa filesystem /app/data segera; jangan restart sampai persistence kembali healthy.' : 'Check the /app/data filesystem immediately; do not restart until persistence is healthy again.'}</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
</DocsLayout>
